<h2>Dispatch</h2>
<p>In-stock orders placed before 2pm Monday–Friday are usually dispatched the same or next working day. You’ll receive tracking details by email as soon as your order leaves our warehouse.</p>
<h2>Checking your delivery</h2>
<p>Please check items for damage before signing. If anything arrives damaged, keep the packaging and contact us within 48 hours with photos and we’ll send a replacement.</p>
